{"id":"ruina","lemma":"ruina","pos":"noun","rank":3721,"glosses":["ruin, decay, wreck (also figurative)","decline, downfall","ruins"],"ipa":"/ˈrwina/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ruinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ruina.wav","examples":[{"text":"Beber fue su ruina.","en":"Drinking was his ruin.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734365","words":[{"g":"to drink"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"El viejo castillo está en ruinas.","en":"The old castle lay in ruins.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641932","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"old person"},{"g":"castle"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Encontramos un cadáver en las ruinas.","en":"We found a corpse in the ruins.","words":[{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"cadaver, corpse"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Vale la pena visitar las ruinas.","en":"The ruins are worth visiting.","words":[{"g":"a voucher"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"punishment, sentence"},{"g":"to visit"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"La ciudad quedó en las ruinas.","en":"The town fell into ruin.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"city"},{"g":"to be , to end up","l":"quedar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}